{"4466930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Are We Sinking Yet?", "steam_appid": 4466930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the river where teamwork is the only thing keeping your raft afloat. Are We Sinking Yet? is a humorous co-op adventure where 2-4 players must paddle together, react to unexpected dangers, and somehow survive the chaotic journey downstream. 🚣</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling the raft is simple… in theory. Paddle on one side and the raft turns that way. But when everyone rows differently or someone refuses to row at all - things quickly go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛶 True Co-op Raft Control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer the raft together by paddling. The direction you row determines where the raft turns, which means coordination is essential to avoid crashes and damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Dangerous River Obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river is full of surprises:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rockfalls crashing into the water<br>- Sudden geysers pushing the raft away<br>- Floating logs and rocks blocking your path<br>- Environmental barriers that act as puzzles you must solve to move forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚑 Survive the Chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The raft can take damage and even break apart. Players can also get hurt or fall overboard — but teammates can rescue them before they disappear into the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍳 Moments Between the Madness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey isn’t only about survival. During calmer moments you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish from the river, cook food on a campfire, throw items at each other, push your friends off balance, use gestures and emotes to communicate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Play With Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a room and invite players using a unique room code. Work together, argue about who rows wrong, and try to keep the raft and your friendships intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Are We Sinking Yet? cooperation is the key to survival… but chaos is guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the river where teamwork is the only thing keeping your raft afloat. Are We Sinking Yet? is a humorous co-op adventure where 2-4 players must paddle together, react to unexpected dangers, and somehow survive the chaotic journey downstream. 🚣</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controlling the raft is simple… in theory. Paddle on one side and the raft turns that way. But when everyone rows differently or someone refuses to row at all - things quickly go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛶 True Co-op Raft Control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer the raft together by paddling. The direction you row determines where the raft turns, which means coordination is essential to avoid crashes and damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 Dangerous River Obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river is full of surprises:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rockfalls crashing into the water<br>- Sudden geysers pushing the raft away<br>- Floating logs and rocks blocking your path<br>- Environmental barriers that act as puzzles you must solve to move forward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚑 Survive the Chaos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The raft can take damage and even break apart. Players can also get hurt or fall overboard — but teammates can rescue them before they disappear into the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍳 Moments Between the Madness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey isn’t only about survival. During calmer moments you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch fish from the river, cook food on a campfire, throw items at each other, push your friends off balance, use gestures and emotes to communicate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Play With Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a room and invite players using a unique room code. Work together, argue about who rows wrong, and try to keep the raft and your friendships intact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Are We Sinking Yet? cooperation is the key to survival… but chaos is guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Are We Sinking Yet? is a chaotic co-op rafting game for 2-4 players where teamwork is the only way to survive. Paddle together to steer your raft, dodge dangerous river obstacles, solve environmental puzzles, and try not to throw your friends overboard.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4466930/028a74cbdcb245b8c1913135222e13c134d25715/header.jpg?t=1784208291", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4466930/fc2a7acd693798a32a5b863d1da4ed57afeb484b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784208291", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4466930/fc2a7acd693798a32a5b863d1da4ed57afeb484b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784208291", "website": "https://spgames.studio/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core Intel i5 or AMD equivalent 4 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core Intel i5 or AMD equivalent 4 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [],